      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Sitting by his bedside, Elena Pavlovna encourages Viktor Petrovich to take care of his health for the sake of his wonderful daughter—and for her own sake too. Once she steps out, a deeply moved Barinov calls the orderly over and asks him to do a quiet favor.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "senya",
      "t": "Вы должны бороться за эту жизнь.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "fedya",
      "t": "У вас такая дочь потрясающая.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "senya",
      "t": "Ну сделайте это для нее.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "fedya",
      "t": "Ну и для меня.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "senya",
      "t": "Я не знаю.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
